# Applied only to ephemeral runners, never the Gateway control plane.
# Ubuntu 24.04 otherwise transitions unconfined user namespaces into the
# restrictive unprivileged_userns profile and prevents Bubblewrap starting.
# The runner remains non-root, cap-drop ALL, read-only, and resource-limited.
# Codex's inner sandbox enforces filesystem and command network permissions.
profile codex-gateway-runner flags=(unconfined) {
    userns,
}
